OL,5,G2235 Behind Bars: World's Toughest
OL,6,G     Prisons
OL,7,     FA high-security prison with an
OL,8,     Farea the size of ten football
OL,9,     Fpitches. Surrounded by
OL,10,     Fsix-metre-high walls, and the sea,
OL,11,     Fthe facility houses up to 800
OL,12,     Fcriminals.
OL,13,G2340 Behind Bars: World's Toughest
OL,14,G     Prisons
OL,15,     FUrso-Branco - the White Bear - is
OL,16,     Fone of the most notorious prisons
OL,17,     Fin Brazil. In the past 20 years
OL,18,     Fmore than 100 people have died in
OL,19,     Friots.
